24) Decisions Addendum (2025-09-26)
	•	Language: EN-only question bank.
	•	Questions: support optional media[] (image) and optional durationSec (20–40). Default 30s.
	•	WebSocket round:start payload includes media? and durationSec?.
	•	Media hosting: Cloudflare R2 + Cloudflare Images/CDN (recommended).
	•	Anti-Google: paraphrase, close distractors, shuffle options server-side.